# Consult the Star Charts looks at one card per land its controller controls, not one per permanent: the Mox Sapphire
# pays for the spells but never widens the look. Unkicked on turn 3 it looks at two and takes one; kicked on turn 5,
# off three Islands and the Mox, it looks at three and takes two. What is left over goes to the bottom, under whatever
# an earlier Consult put there.

